    "text": "At the {BALL} at the Crown, Mr. Knightley will not dance; he stands among the {ELDERLY} men, tall and {STRAIGHT}. Mr. Elton {SNUBS} Harriet in front of everyone, and Mrs. Elton {SMIRKS}. Then Mr. Knightley {LEADS} Harriet to the set himself, and Emma could kiss him for it.",
